# No agent attribution

Do not attribute work in this repository to Cursor, Claude, or any other agent.

## Commits

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` or any `cursoragent@` trailer.
- Never add "Made with Cursor", "Generated by Cursor", or similar footers.
- Commit as the user's git identity only.
- If a generated message already has those trailers, strip them before committing.

## Pull requests and issues

- Do not attribute the PR to Cursor or an agent in the title, body, or reviewers.
- Do not add "Made with Cursor" or agent badges to PR descriptions.
- Create PRs with `gh` as the authenticated GitHub user.

## Example

```
# BAD
Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>

# GOOD
(no agent trailer; author is the user's git name/email)
```
